	quest.1182C75984E97F38.quest_desc: ["&aSophisticated Storage&r is a great way to have an expandable storage using &eTom's Simple Storage&r early game!"]
	quest.14002F69CC0BDA66.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &eMob Grinding Utils&r! This mod will be used to &bautomate the collection of resources  obtain from killing mobs or passive animals&r you may need to craft certain items! Consider using &6Functional Storage&r and &dlinking&r it to your storage system."]
