	quest.27417F4710DE9E7F.title: "Furnace Upgrades"
	quest.27776C46C5D43BED.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the &bRefined Storage&r chapter! In this chapter you'll learn what is new and returned in the new update of this mod!"]
	quest.28BE143548F120E1.quest_subtitle: "Onto the Creative Items!"
	quest.2C84A8F90D4717E7.quest_desc: ["This section of the chapter is dedicated for beginner farms! Using mods such as &aMystical Agriculture, Easy Villagers, and Multipart Machines: Farming&f!"]
	quest.2C84A8F90D4717E7.quest_subtitle: "Farmers Unite!"
	quest.2CCCF170B8A40D74.quest_desc: ["The Modular Centrifuge is built the same way as the Modular Beehive!"]
	quest.2CCCF170B8A40D74.title: "Build the Modular Centrifuge Structure"
	quest.2ED0E657E91529C4.quest_desc: ["The &aHarvester Pylon&r allows you to automatically harvest crops up to a &e9x9 area&r! In order to make it harvest the crops, you must craft a hoe for it."]
	quest.31E97C1B6E0201D0.title: "Craft a Crafting Grid"
	quest.3935CAEC212C00F9.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the &5Applied Energistics 2&r chapter! In this chapter, you'll be able to learn the progression of this mod and possibly learn new information that has been introduced in this update of Minecraft!"]
	quest.397F8270A5018CCD.quest_desc: [
		"In order to successfully build the &eModular Beehive&r, you must build a &c3x3x3 cube&r and fill the entire cube with &l1x Modular Beehive&r at the center and &l26x Beehive Stucture Box&r."
		"{image:adventureoftechv:textures/quests/modularbeehive.png width:256 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.397F8270A5018CCD.title: "Build the Modular Beehive Structure"
	quest.3A67EEFE8B073AE9.title: "Mechanical Belt"
	quest.3B0DC82684829907.title: "Mega Botany Pots"
	quest.3C8E7BBBF2ADD4C0.title: "Craft a Tertium Crystal"
	quest.3E7BE92407F04631.title: "Craft the Infusion Alter"
	quest.40194D4CC09E8E0D.title: "Craft a Master Infusion Crystal"
	quest.4215F50BE2D12654.title: "Accuire Fluix Crystals"
	quest.4377A05EBF4F78EB.title: "Craft a Controller"
	quest.44EFED10DFF09999.quest_desc: ["These treats can be used to up the Productivity Rate to &e350%&r! With Royal providing the least improvement, and Soul provides the best improvement!"]
	quest.44EFED10DFF09999.title: "Upping the Productivity"
	quest.45FF587664764625.quest_desc: ["The &aInterdiction Pylon&r allows you to prevent mob spawning within a configurable amount of chunks! Using the &6Mob Filter&r, you can filter which mobs can spawn or not. If you use the &cLifeless Filter&r, you will not be able to use the Mob Filter as it &ldisables&r them, using the Lifeless Filter you can prevent mob spawning up to &e25x25 chunks&r!"]
	quest.46B33AD5DFC90420.quest_desc: ["These blocks can be added to any side of the Modular Beehive to improve the basic hive you created! The &6Alveary&r is used to allow bees to go into the Modular Beehive from bee cages! While the &aFeeder&r is used to feed the bees and the &eTreater&r is used to give them treats that can improve their productivity!"]
	quest.46B33AD5DFC90420.title: "Additional Beehive Blocks"
	quest.488E5E3C93CBD8CD.quest_desc: ["There are various &6Upgrades&r for the &eMob Masher&r, &bAbsorption Hopper&r, &aMob Fan&r, and &cEntity Spawner&r! These upgrades can be used to make your Mob killing area greater and bigger!"]
	quest.492961F3EE049136.title: "Craft an Inscriber"
	quest.49C72D55F32358D3.quest_desc: ["&aElectrodes&r can be used to speed up the process of the Modular Beehive and Centrifuge! Craft an &zOverclocker&r for the Beehive and Centrifuge and you can add it to any side of the structures!"]
	quest.49C72D55F32358D3.title: "Speeding Up the Process"
	quest.4F8C842C683BAB17.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &6Modular Bees&r! Put a honey block in a &eCentrifuge&r in order to obtain &aHoney Jelly&r!"]
	quest.4F8C842C683BAB17.title: "Welcome to Modular Bees!"
	quest.4FFDC05632869C03.title: "Craft an Autocrafter"
	quest.5137C172A15C9E09.quest_desc: ["The &aInfusion Pylon&r allows you to apply a potion effect from any distance using the &epotion filter&r!"]
	quest.5426A91B178A0A10.title: "Elite Botany Pots"
	quest.54500814BCF0578D.title: "Craft a Crafting Terminal"
	quest.551DF561E42F9D29.quest_desc: ["&l&bPylons&r&r are one of the many ways you can automate farming in this pack! Using Pylons in combination with the fertilizer lilypads from &bReliquary&r, you can farm crops quicker than other methods of farming."]
	quest.551DF561E42F9D29.title: "Pylons"
	quest.58A0E0528A7630E6.title: "Craft a Supremium Crystal"
	quest.593E4AC07A8DF8DE.quest_desc: ["Click '&lU&r' on the &eFission Reactor Casing&r. Using &6Just Enough Mekanism Multiblocks&r, you can build a reactor of the size you pick and see how much materials you'll need to build it and see how much fuel you can burn per tick before damaging the reactor!"]
	quest.593E4AC07A8DF8DE.quest_subtitle: "Reaction Time!"
	quest.5BA0DC32707A373B.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the &3Final Chapter&r of &zAdventure of Tech V&r! This has truly been a great journey and I hope you all had fun! This chapter will display all of the creative items that are craftable!"]
	quest.5D04806572C2FAA6.title: "Build a Supercritical Phase Shifter"
	quest.61C26A145BD6832D.quest_desc: ["Refer to the &eDictionary of Spirits&r to see how to set this ritual up!"]
	quest.61C26A145BD6832D.title: "Prepping for the Ritual"
	quest.63485E529777E3B1.quest_desc: ["You'll need more if you intend on making the full sized Quantum Crafter!"]
	quest.65665693725A1F5B.title: "Craft an ME Crafting Terminal"
	quest.659C036F8022FF0B.quest_desc: ["There are various &eUpgrade Cards&r you can add to your &5Quantum&r armor. Such as, flight, water breathing, auto feeding, and more!"]
	quest.659C036F8022FF0B.title: "Upgrade Cards"
	quest.6638269A7C0500E6.title: "Craft Andesite Alloy"
	quest.676A85A309DE0C74.title: "Craft a Disk Drive"
	quest.679C1F366BCDF5F5.title: "Stone Tools"
	quest.6AD835CDA672A37D.quest_desc: ["Chests from Sophisticated Storage can be upgraded to allow more storage space! These chests can also become double chests like vanilla chests!"]
	quest.6B727C8ED6FABF3A.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the &5Occultism&r chapter! In this chapter, you'll learn how to prep and do the ritual to get the &cSmithing Template&r so that you can start making things that requires it!"]
	quest.6B727C8ED6FABF3A.title: "Welcome to Occultism!"
	quest.6BBC837D5B021B1F.title: "Craft an ME Terminal"
	quest.6E0FB8882B9E8386.quest_desc: ["With &dBotany Pots Tiers&r in the pack, you can upgrade your Botany Pots! These upgrades can make your Botany Pots faster and yield more harvest! &8&lElite&r&r is x2 Speed and Multiplier, &9Ultra&r is x6 Speed and x3 Multiplier, and &cMega&r is x10 Speed and x4 Multiplier."]
	quest.6E0FB8882B9E8386.title: "Botany Pots Upgrades"
	quest.7061180F8577AE74.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the &eFunctional Storage&r chapter! Functional Storage is very useful for storing items and liquids and you can connected to your ME or RS storage system externally!"]
	quest.7061180F8577AE74.title: "Storage that is Functional"
	quest.723C98F8EF6C701F.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &bAdventure of Tech V&f! This pack has mods that we all love with more that are exclusive to this version of Minecraft! Have fun on this adventure that you are about to embark on!"]
	quest.723C98F8EF6C701F.quest_subtitle: "Off to Another Adventure!"
	quest.723C98F8EF6C701F.title: "Welcome to Adventure of Tech V!"
	quest.72DF5E52333812C1.quest_desc: ["Threw these in the &5Spiritfire&r!"]
	quest.72DF5E52333812C1.title: "All The Chalks"
	quest.731B2A66FCF22E93.quest_desc: ["There are various ways to handle your storage before you get into digital storage, using &eSophisticated Storage&r, &dArs Nouveau&r, and &6Tom's Simple Storage&r!"]
	quest.731B2A66FCF22E93.title: "I Need Space!"
	quest.745AC10BA1D7555E.title: "Craft a Storage Terminal"
	quest.74AA74CC819EC4C1.title: "Craft an Advanced Beehive"
	quest.75860FF6BB645AC5.title: "Steam Engine"
	quest.75F883E3C295F8F2.title: "Craft an ME Drive"
	quest.770E4A5943420D61.quest_desc: ["Finding a &emetorite&r is the first and crucial step to getting started with AE2. In the metorite you will find a mysterious cube that has the presses you'll need later and &3Certus Quartz&r clusters!"]
	quest.7962871090011400.quest_desc: ["The &aExpulsion Pylon&r allows you to keep other players out of your base chunks! Using the &ePlayer Filter&r, you can filter who can be in the chunks of your base or not. This is mainly for multiplayer use."]
